auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1408445ca6a85c3b88c76823e6cd1482 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ねごと様、いつも素晴らしいイラストありがとうございます。\n\nこの度リクエストさせて頂きますのは、「機動戦士ガンダムSEED C.E.73STARGAZER」の「ミューディー・ホルクロフト」です。\n\n衣装は劇中着用のヘソ出しのピンク色の制服で、体型は巨乳かつむっちりした太もも、割れた腹筋という形で、敵の兵士たちを蹴散らし自信満々な顔で佇んでいるという形でお願いいたします。\n\nご検討、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1epGhYMvqIZMnTa4At8ofNkSfOJgn6LMP\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nIYdyWTnM9GS0hhuGBdzBiRSn1mrWd3r\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1epGhYMvqIZMnTa4At8ofNkSfOJgn6LMP", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negoto5252/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c674536a/uploads/origins/443f4622-e0c3-41f4-b06a-f6e9efe73389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80f9fdfba62dff020588f4b9f6579ff9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c674536a/uploads/origins/443f4622-e0c3-41f4-b06a-f6e9efe73389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80f9fdfba62dff020588f4b9f6579ff9, https://si.imgix.net/c674536a/uploads/origins/443f4622-e0c3-41f4-b06a-f6e9efe73389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1b73cbc748fc0ca6293f3f886c9a66f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c674536a/uploads/origins/443f4622-e0c3-41f4-b06a-f6e9efe73389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5a8b400a59ed29e6a65980215986cda 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "On the edge of a cliff where the waves crash, we have a muscular Boa Hancock Futa with Monkey D. Luffy inside her (the pirate's entire body is inside the shaft except for his head, which is positioned at the opening of the glans). The empress's pleasure is so intense that she strikes her signature pose as she orgasms, propelling Luffy like a cannonball towards Laugh Tale.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negoto5252/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.im